[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115] --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   Step 115 -- mixture posterior-predictive audit of resident cohorts.
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   The registered prospective prediction (step_054) is conditional on a
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   cohort's discovery geometry: the expected in-cap rate under EITHER
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   model is a function of where the cohort was discovered pointing.
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   The footprint-only model predicts the in-cap rate through the
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   coupling-smear baseline; the TEP mixture predicts it through the
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   per-object posterior P(varpi in cap | lam_opp).  For a cohort
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   discovered looking toward the anti-axis sector the two predictions
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   nearly coincide (the intrinsic-axis population is rarely discoverable
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   there), while a cohort discovered looking at the axis sector
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   separates them by tens of points.  The newest provisional cohort --
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   scored "untested" in step_084 -- can therefore be scored after all:
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   against the prediction each model makes FOR ITS OWN pointing.
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   Generative models compared:
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   H0  footprint only:  varpi | lam ~ WN(lam, sigma_c)
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   -> per-object in-cap probability = the established smear_cap
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   baseline of steps 014/054/085/112/113.
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   H1  TEP mixture (step_025 fit, registered in step_054):
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   varpi ~ f * WN(axis, sigma_int) + (1 - f) * Uniform,
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   lam | varpi ~ WN(varpi, sigma_c)
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   -> per-object posterior P(varpi in cap | lam_i) by Bayes on a
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   0.25 deg longitude grid (720-point circle).
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   For every cohort the step reports the observed in-cap count, the
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   expected count under each model, the exact Poisson-binomial
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   probability of the observed count under each model, and the
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   per-cohort Bayes factor P(k|H1)/P(k|H0).  A deduplicated union
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   (same precedence as step_113) carries the joint factor, and a
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   discovery-longitude lever-arm map shows where a future cohort is
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   decisive.  Provisional-orbit quality is assessed from the data
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   itself: the circular scatter of (varpi - lam_opp) residuals on the
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   newest cohort versus the secure cohort.
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   Cohorts (constructed exactly as in steps 113/084):
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   SBDB      secure detached a>150, q>30, cc<=3  (designation proxy)
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   DES       detached a>150, q>30                (designation proxy)
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   OSSOS     'det' class                         (exact astrometry)
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   2025+     detached a>150, q>30, designation year >= 2025, any cc
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   (provisional orbits; designation proxy)
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   era bins  the full SBDB detached pool (any cc) split by
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   designation year -- 2000-05, 2006-10, 2011-15, 2016-19,
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   2020-22, 2023-24, 2025+ -- scoring whether the signature
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   persists across discovery generations and whether each
[2026-09-20 13:01:41 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 115]   generation's count matches what its own pointing predicts
